    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power of Golden Slammer</strong>\u00a0is a game about being a kid in the 90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/39e6e46cfd436962bfda3ef9b46d2a25.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/39e6e46cfd436962bfda3ef9b46d2a25.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/39e6e46cfd436962bfda3ef9b46d2a25.mp4?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding your <strong>skateboard</strong> around different parts of town, battling other kids, mowing lawns to earn <strong>money</strong> to buy more <strong>slammers</strong> at the video store and <strong>collecting</strong> <i>rad</i> items like electronic LCD handheld games, slap bracelets and wearable items which increase your <strong>coolness</strong>!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/f6686c2df889583fa2f9288e35b85296.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power of Golden Slammer doesn't just have SLAMMERS it has BLADE, HOLOGRAPHIC <i>and</i> <strong>HOLOGRAPHIC BLADE </strong>CAPS\u00a0<i>AND</i> SLAMMERS!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/474f959ecf372d4e3c83206f7df70f72.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=183 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/474f959ecf372d4e3c83206f7df70f72.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8ca75efe8dc314becb8b9aaeae5630fe.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=124 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8ca75efe8dc314becb8b9aaeae5630fe.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/83470ebf991001889cbdde71fe7504dd.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=129 height=131 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/83470ebf991001889cbdde71fe7504dd.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/4f46ddef0d5984a7fbe27a1837f4b1de.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/4f46ddef0d5984a7fbe27a1837f4b1de.webp?t=1750446630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=129 height=122 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be wondering\u00a0\u201cHow does a battle actually work?\u201d To summarize,\u00a0<strong>the player and the opponent take turns slamming a stack of caps with their slammer and keep whichever caps flip over on their turn.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.apng?t=1750446630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=48 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battle you have a limited number of turns and can either do a normal slam by using the \u201cSLAM\u201d button as it appears or you can use your one shot\u00a0<strong>SPECIAL SLAM</strong>\u00a0and attempt to\u00a0<strong>use the power of leverage to get a really sweet payout</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/0a56dd1c43b2fcfa880b0b89be55ef73.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skateboarding</strong> in P.O.G.S. is <strong>radical</strong>! With   lightning fast responsive movement and controls that allow you to turn on a dime , skate in third or first person and do <strong>impossible</strong> tricks.\u00a0<strong>GNARLY!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/3d22016988833cf8e4a3a5f1dfc6d15a.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/3d22016988833cf8e4a3a5f1dfc6d15a.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/ab52f66bdd2e1511fb2f47960f9664f3.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being <strong>cool</strong> is essential to gaining access to different parts of town.\u00a0Many wearable items directly affect your <strong>coolness</strong> level allowing you to impress your peers and even adults. <strong>WOAH!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8e9688659adea7da48ff51859219a635.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8e9688659adea7da48ff51859219a635.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/07ed9463fa2d409d559a5806e8255c5d.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These little cardboard circles with pictures on them are expensive! Good thing you're an industrious go getter. If you happen to be low on caps or just want to expand your collection you can do things like mow lawns for money to purchase caps and slammers at the video store. <strong>CHA-CHING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/7a66cb45cae3edc6ee560324a01b02ad.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/7a66cb45cae3edc6ee560324a01b02ad.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/edd7f2f379395fd9dcfc610abbd20186.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your idyllic summer vacation as a P.O.G.S. kid you will collect cool wearable items, toys and of <i>course</i>\u00a0<strong>rare</strong> caps and slammers. P.O.G.S. already features <strong>many items</strong> suggested by <strong>90s enthusiasts</strong>\u00a0(check the discussions) and <strong>we're only getting started</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/d6adc19ad0e296e8789b53e21228c313.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/d6adc19ad0e296e8789b53e21228c313.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.apng?t=1750446630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=48 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you so much for your interest in Power of Golden Slammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br>See you at the video store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/0dd452473e273d2a5813aeadbc922d96.avif?t=1750446630\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
