to gaining access to different parts of town.\u00a0Many wearable items directly affect your <strong>coolness</strong> level allowing you to impress your peers and even adults. <strong>WOAH!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8e9688659adea7da48ff51859219a635.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/8e9688659adea7da48ff51859219a635.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/07ed9463fa2d409d559a5806e8255c5d.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These little cardboard circles with pictures on them are expensive! Good thing you're an industrious go getter. If you happen to be low on caps or just want to expand your collection you can do things like mow lawns for money to purchase caps and slammers at the video store. <strong>CHA-CHING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/7a66cb45cae3edc6ee560324a01b02ad.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/7a66cb45cae3edc6ee560324a01b02ad.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/edd7f2f379395fd9dcfc610abbd20186.avif?t=1750446630\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your idyllic summer vacation as a P.O.G.S. kid you will collect cool wearable items, toys and of <i>course</i>\u00a0<strong>rare</strong> caps and slammers. P.O.G.S. already features <strong>many items</strong> suggested by <strong>90s enthusiasts</strong>\u00a0(check the discussions) and <strong>we're only getting started</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/d6adc19ad0e296e8789b53e21228c313.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/d6adc19ad0e296e8789b53e21228c313.webm?t=1750446630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.poster.avif?t=1750446630\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/eed321b9a704fcfe41e2c5200a1b4c8c.apng?t=1750446630\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=48 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you so much for your interest in Power of Golden Slammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br>See you at the video store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640790/extras/0dd452473e273d2a5813aeadbc922d96.avif?t=1750446630\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p