        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2500 Mhz 4 Core or similar <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> (For LITE mode which is an option at launch): Integrated graphics like AMD Radeon R5 Graphics or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These are the current minimum specs similar to a non-gaming laptop which was used for testing the LITE mode (an option given at launch). The LITE mode uses a much lighter rendering method than the standard build.</li></ul>",
